				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hi Dawnraiders!
<br />

<br />
I am Spamonca, 65 iksar monk with 108aa's at the moment. (have epic, but what monk doesnt these days)
<br />
Not long moved over from Zeb server, reason for that was my old guild began raiding at 3am GMT which was just too hard to keep up with.
<br />

<br />
I am currently Elemental flagged and have my Emp/VT key, also have BoT towers key and Ssra Cre key.
<br />

<br />
I have jboots/telescope for instant clicky items and invis/shrinking devices, so i can mobilize to zones no problem.
<br />

<br />
What i am lookin for in a guild : Looking to be part of a family, always willing to help each other and Raid some high end zones while making new friends, which is why i think dawnraiders would be good for me, since coming over i've only heard good things about DR and realize you guys are pretty well respected.
<br />

<br />
Real life info : Well my name is john, am 20 years old, 21 in feb, cant wait for a big party!!, just doing a bit of casual work here and there, so i can be on alot.
<br />

<br />
Past EQ experiences : Well i've raided most of velious/kunark and all of luclin and as far as the elemental planes of PoP, also another good reason for wanna join DR as i dont want to skip content and DR are just where i left off on zeb.
<br />

<br />
Magelo : <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=253838" target="_blank">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=253838</a>
<br />

<br />
If i have missed anything or you feel like asking me any questions, /tell Spamonca in game or reply here, Thanks for your time and hope to raid with you all in the future.  <img src="images/smiles/icon_cool.gif" alt="Cool" border="0" /></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
